0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#the-connection-is-one-stream","title":"The connection is one stream"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-filesystem-and-the-hardlink-that-everything-depends-on","title":"The filesystem, and the hardlink that everything depends on"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-isolation-you-actually-get","title":"What isolation you actually get"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-environment-is-built-from-nothing","title":"The environment is built from nothing"},{"depth":2,"url":"#timeouts-signals-and-the-output-you-lose","title":"Timeouts, signals, and the output you lose"},{"depth":2,"url":"#uploading-outputs-and-what-is-dropped","title":"Uploading outputs, and what is dropped"},{"depth":2,"url":"#cleanup-and-three-things-called-eviction","title":"Cleanup, and three things called eviction"},{"depth":2,"url":"#where-the-exact-truth-lives","title":"Where the exact truth lives"},{"depth":2,"url":"#common-questions","title":"Common questions"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"Worker execution"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"How an action becomes a running process: input materialization, what isolation you actually get, and what the worker throws away."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone running workers, debugging an action that behaves\ndifferently on a worker than locally, or deciding how much to trust the\nactions they run. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end:"}]," the lifecycle, the\nfilesystem layout, the exact isolation boundary, and the list of things the\nworker deliberately discards. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," twenty-five minutes."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"The worker is where the abstractions stop. Everything upstream is digests and\nstate machines; here there is a directory, a process, and an exit code. Most\nof the surprising behaviour in a Forge cluster originates in this crate,\nbecause this is the only place where the operating system gets a vote."}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"as":"h2","id":"the-connection-is-one-stream","children":"The connection is one stream"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["A worker opens exactly one bidirectional gRPC stream to the scheduler\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"ConnectWorker"}],", the sole RPC on Forge's own ",["$","code",null,{"children":"WorkerApi"}]," service), and\neverything flows over it. It has no polling loop and no second connection."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The worker supplies only an ID ",["$","em",null,{"children":"prefix"}],"; the scheduler mints the actual\nworker ID by appending a UUIDv6, so IDs are unique and time-ordered. Which\nworker gets an action is decided separately, by the LRU-ordered\n",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/explanations/scheduler-internals#matching-is-first-fit-over-an-lru","children":"matching engine"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50/60 text-foreground dark:bg-amber-500/10","role":"alert","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"The heartbeat and the eviction timeout are two separate knobs"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["The worker's heartbeat period is derived as ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"half"}]," its configured\n","$L8",", 2.5 seconds by default. Eviction is\ngoverned by the ","$L9"," ","$La",", 10 seconds by default\n(four heartbeats). Any message from the worker refreshes the clock, not\nonly the heartbeat. Nothing reconciles the two knobs. Raise the worker's\ntimeout without raising the scheduler's and you get workers evicted\nmid-heartbeat and reconnecting in a loop."]}]]}]]}],"\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e"]}],"$L3f"]}],["$L40","$L41"],"$L42"]}],"isPartial":"$@43","staleTime":"$44","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L45","isPartial":"$@46","staleTime":"$44","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L47","isPartial":"$@48","staleTime":"$44","varyParams":"$49"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@4a","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@4b"}
